From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:54:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] TileLang Engram gate kernel

DeepSeek's signed-sqrt gate (TileKernels engram_gate_fwd arithmetic) as a custom
op, with one 256-thread block per token and stream and every load issued before
the reduction. The Engram module imports the kernel switch its TileLang paths
will use. No caller yet.
